    "Cloudless is a small, local-first product that relies on growth through word of mouth. By featuring us in your next YouTube video (or on other platforms), you help us keep building dictation that never leaves your Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudless is a small, local-first product that relies on growth through word of mouth. By featuring us in your next YouTube video (or on other platforms), you help us keep building dictation that never leaves your Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudless est un petit produit qui privilégie le local et compte sur le bouche-à-oreille pour sa croissance. En nous présentant dans votre prochaine vidéo YouTube (ou sur d’autres plateformes), vous nous aidez à continuer de développer une dictée qui ne quitte jamais votre Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloudless is free & local": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudless is free & local"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloudless is much better than Apple's built-in dictation (has a custom-built cleanup model).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudless is much better than Apple's built-in dictation (has a custom-built cleanup model)."
